Check member invariants across an experimental recursive module group as one definition, including dependencies through provided type synonyms and recursive component types, and raw type tests and conversions in functions reached by an invariant. The hidden `--legacy-recursive-module-invariants` restores the previous unsound per-module extension-analysis scope for comparison and migration; it leaves the general dependence-cache repair (issue 504) enabled. `--recursive-modules` remains hidden and opt-in.
